# 99 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria [S] with Steamed Rams accepted, the WotG mission Her Memories current and the Blue
# Recommendation Letter. Windurst Waters [S]: Snake on the Plains pledged: allegiance 3. North Gustaberg [S], then
# Bastok Markets [S] from there at Prog 0: nothing (Azure needs allegiance 2).
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Mainchelite/onTrigger WindurstWatersS/Miah_Riyuh/onTrigger WindurstWatersS/onEventFinish/105 WindurstWatersS/onEventFinish/106 BastokMarketsS/onZoneIn/1
